-44fc19005f36" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389952}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "91adcabf-d5e4-5b26-b108-725e1daa2469" :question/math-academy-id "q-182341" :question/problem "Find the missing values in the following truth table:\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,¬((A∧B)∧A)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-4}} |" :question/worked-solution "First, we add a column for the part of the expression that's in parentheses, $A∧B:$\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nThen, we add a column for $(A∧B)∧A:$\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ | $\\,(A∧B)∧A\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nFinally, we add a column for the negation $¬((A∧B)∧A):$\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ | $\\,(A∧B)∧A\\,$ | $\\,¬((A∧B)∧A)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186389955 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7c49d316-3552-5ace-a749-5070b64230c3" :knowledge-point/title "Completing a Truth Table for a Compound Statement"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c1eae6b-3f32-5dd3-acc5-25f7b54d2071" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389957} {:answer/id #uuid "600aa387-4977-5494-8844-5eea498b0b39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389958}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "600aa387-4977-5494-8844-5eea498b0b39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389958} :answer-field/id #uuid "d3aaa2c3-1f11-5fa7-8c6c-15ab816e4667" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389956} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e2328bcd-704f-583b-89ab-832b55d7b386" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389960} {:answer/id #uuid "d22d240a-c363-5fe2-9dbb-895f107e0453" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389961}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d22d240a-c363-5fe2-9dbb-895f107e0453" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389961} :answer-field/id #uuid "1492d1ac-1e1c-5388-bcc1-45114d6d42f6" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389959} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "740517a2-f255-5a50-925f-09b53fefdbbf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389963} {:answer/id #uuid "4882957d-e1f0-5fd1-9d2b-dad1ddab90ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389964}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4882957d-e1f0-5fd1-9d2b-dad1ddab90ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186389964} :answer-field/id #